    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This circlet lets its wearer wipe from memory all knowledge of a particular deed or period of their life—handy for anyone who fears mages prying into their mind.</p><p>While wearing it, you can take a Magic action to name a trigger, such as “after I leave this temple” or “when I cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAnimateDea]{Animate Dead} spell.” If that trigger occurs within the next 24 hours, the circlet erases your memories of everything from the moment you set the trigger until the trigger occurred. No magic short of a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWish000000]{Wish} spell can restore your memories of that time. Once you use this property, you can’t use it again until the next dawn.</p>",
